# Line endings are a repo guarantee, not a per-machine one.
#
# Every text file in this repo is stored LF in the index today, but only because
# the machine it was authored on happens to have core.autocrlf=true set in its
# system gitconfig. That is one developer's local setting, not a property of the
# repo, so the next contributor to clone would commit CRLF and turn the first
# shared edit into a whole-file diff. Normalise it here instead.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never line-ending converted, never diffed as text.
#
# Only *.ico and *.png are tracked right now. The rest are listed because they
# are the binary formats this project actually produces or vendors, and a single
# CRLF substitution inside any of them is silent, total corruption: *.woff2 for
# the fonts vendored into app/fonts/, *.exe for the NSIS installer, *.mcpb for
# the Claude Desktop extension bundle, *.onnx for the models fetched at runtime.
*.ico   binary
*.png   binary
*.woff2 binary
*.exe   binary
*.mcpb  binary
*.onnx  binary
